.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-invoices-download - Download an invoice PDF


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago invoices download  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint is used for downloading a specific invoice PDF document. Only \fBfinalized\fR invoices can be downloaded; any other invoice returns a \fB404\fR error.
When the PDF has already been generated, the invoice object is returned and its \fBfile_url\fR points to the document. When it has not been generated yet, the response is a \fB200\fR with an empty body and the generation starts in the background. Call the endpoint again to get the invoice object with its \fBfile_url\fR\&.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for download


